# Retraining-experiment artifacts: 15 candidates x ~2.4 MB of weights, all
# reproducible from the frozen recipe and seeds in
# artifacts/evaluations/dead-head-retrain-prereg-2026-08-27.md. The result
# that matters -- dead-head-retrain-2026-08-27.json -- is tracked.
artifacts/deadhead/

# Janitor archive (2026-09-02; archive/README.md maps every move). The tracked
# half, archive/pre-reset-2026-08-16/, is git-mv'd history. The data half holds
# the moved gitignored bulk -- the v7 corpora, the deadhead retrain set, the
# stale Eval bundle, the 2026-08-12 anti-slop audit, the 2026-08-26 journal
# backup -- and must stay ignored: it is ~777 MB.
archive/data/

# PHH dataset (2026-09-03): a junction to D:/phh-dataset
# (github.com/uoftcprg/phh-dataset, tag v3). Clone, never commit.
phh-dataset/
# Phase-A datasets built from PHH run to 100+ MB; their .summary.json
# sidecars stay tracked as the record.
artifacts/phase_a_v9/*pluribus*.jsonl.gz

# Training environment (2026-09-03): a clone of
